  "title": "Kolkata Police File FIR Against Mamata Banerjee for Calcutta High Court Order Violation",
  "summary": "The Kolkata Police have filed an FIR against former West Bengal Chief Minister Mamata Banerjee and organisers of the TMCP foundation day programme, alleging violations of conditions imposed by the Calcutta High Court. The case has sparked a fresh political controversy in the state.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The Calcutta High Court ordered the event to be held from 12 p.m. to 3 p.m. (12:00-03:00 PM).",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The rally, however, went beyond 3 p.m., as the former Chief Minister could not finish her speech in time.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The police registered an FIR against the individuals and the event organizers.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
